<title>FINLAND: Finnish raw wood prices rise in May - METLA.</title>
<headline>Finnish raw wood prices rise in May - METLA.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish raw wood stumpage prices were mostly higher in May (weeks 19-22), the Finnish Forest Research Institute METLA said in a statement on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Birch pulpwood stumpage prices were steady in May, it said.</p>
<p>Pulpwood stumpage prices (markka per cubic metre):</p>
<p>		May '97    April '97    March '97    Feb '97</p>
<p> Pine	  96.60	96.40	  96.20	  96.70</p>
<p> Spruce     130.60     128.80	 127.40	 126.70</p>
<p> Birch	 94.40	94.40	  94.50	  94.30</p>
<p>Logwood stumpage prices (markka per cubic metre):</p>
<p>		May '97    April '97    March '97    Feb '97</p>
<p> Pine	 266.90     264.60	 255.10	 252.20</p>
<p> Spruce     218.30     215.70	 210.40	 208.80</p>
<p> Birch	264.80     261.50	 252.20	 250.20</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom  +358 - 0 - 680 50 245, news@reuter.fi</p>
</text>
